Coders Note:
	
   Official release date: 2:th Of September 1993.

   This demo will not work on a Tseng 3000, and we have not had the time
   to test it on too many machines.

   The main reason for the delay (except for strange bugs) is that we are
   currently developing a Virtual Reality Graphics System. This will keep
   us busy from doing public domain demos, probably...

   DonÔt get sad about that, instead keep your eyes open next time you
   pass your local arcade hall (!).	 
   
   Ok, I hope we have cleared up some of the rumours (which were true!)
   and we hope you enjoyed this demo.

